[Name] GSettings-Desktop-Schemas
[Summary] GSettings schemas for desktop apps (GNOME standard)
[Description] GSettings-Desktop-Schemas is the canonical set of GSettings schemas for the GNOME desktop (interface, sound, peripherals, etc.). Mutter 48+ requires >= 40.alpha. Build AFTER GLib 2.84 + JSON-GLib and BEFORE gnome-desktop-4 + Mutter. Track: ~/.claude/projects/-home-nohearth-Projects-BuildLiveCD/memory/pantheon-stack-port.md
